Historical compatibility note:
Earlier development used the Apache-2.0-licensed CAi Molecule Design Copilot
as an application scaffold:
https://github.com/datamllab/CAi_copilot

The submission artifact has since been separated into the standalone `egvr`
research package. The original CAi conversational shell, Web UI, CLI, REPL,
skills, utilities, and bundled tool-server application are not part of the
EGVR-Agent artifact. The new package focuses on structured task planning,
execution records, evidence verification, bounded repair, trace auditing, and
reliability benchmarks.

